@startuml
title SSD 6 — Make Availability
hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
actor AdministrativeStaff as Staff
participant ":System" as System
Staff -> System: makeAvailability(professionalID, locationID, dateRange,\nrecurrence, startTime, endTime, slotMinutes)
note over Staff,System
recurrence = weekly(set of weekdays) or monthly(dayOfMonth).
Date bounds are inclusive. A missing monthly day (e.g. Feb 31) is skipped.
end note
alt professional/location missing, malformed pattern, or invalid time/slot length
  System --> Staff: notFound / invalidInput
else generated interval overlaps existing availability
  System --> Staff: duplicateAvailability (no partial creation)
else valid pattern and all generated intervals are conflict-free
  System --> Staff: scheduleID, created slot IDs (possibly empty if no occurrence)
end
note over Staff,System
Whole slots only; the daily interval must divide exactly by slotMinutes.
Example: November 2026, weekly Mondays, 09:00–12:00, slotMinutes = 30.
Creating professional availability does not reserve rooms, equipment or assisting roles.
end note
@enduml
